      {
        "sid": "S6",
        "pid": "P4",
        "start": 129,
        "end": 146,
        "text": "凉的那面朝下，热的那面朝——街尾。",
        "type": "ending_template",
        "rule": "deai_ending_template",
        "severity": 2,
        "source": "rule"
      },
      {
        "sid": "S16",
        "pid": "P9",
        "start": 340,
        "end": 373,
        "text": "是我先入为主，看见旧字就认旧库——毛病，跟我那台旧座钟一个德性。”",
        "type": "ending_template",
        "rule": "deai_ending_template",
        "severity": 2,
        "source": "rule"
      },
      {
        "sid": "S25",
        "pid": "P14",
        "start": 537,
        "end": 574,
        "text": "他不听声音，只听磨痕——每件旧物被搬运时，都会在边角留下一道极细的“响”。",
        "type": "ending_template",
        "rule": "deai_ending_template",
        "severity": 2,
        "source": "rule"
      },
      {
        "sid": "S57",
        "pid": "P34",
        "start": 1171,
        "end": 1212,
        "text": "他没吭声，只把手攥了攥，“走快了更烫，慢一点反而凉——说明它是被人攥着走了一段。”",
        "type": "ending_template",
        "rule": "deai_ending_template",
        "severity": 2,
        "source": "rule"
      },
      {
        "sid": "S91",
        "pid": "P55",
        "start": 1742,
        "end": 1786,
        "text": "我这摊上三十六件旧器，都是祖上传下来的，您要这么说，我可得问一句——您这是要砸我饭碗？”",
        "type": "ending_template",
        "rule": "deai_ending_template",
        "severity": 2,
        "source": "rule"
      },
      {
        "sid": "S107",
        "pid": "P63",
        "start": 2043,
        "end": 2081,
        "text": "这一件锈多，那一件锈少——说明锈多的才是真货，那件亮的，是新打的，冒充老的！",
        "type": "ending_template",
        "rule": "deai_ending_template",
        "severity": 2,
        "source": "rule"
      },
      {
        "sid": "S131",
        "pid": "P78",
        "start": 2436,
        "end": 2492,
        "text": "这回韩汀蕙不再犹豫，刀贴着壶肚一抹，铜皮应声而开,底下露出另一层暗沉的旧绿,真正的老锈像年轮一样一圈一圈往里沉。",
        "type": "cliche_simile",
        "rule": "deai_cliche_simile",
        "severity": 2,
        "source": "rule"
      },
      {
        "sid": "S138",
        "pid": "P81",
        "start": 2587,
        "end": 2626,
        "text": "您说不清，它就还是个来路不明的旧壶——按联盟的规矩，来路不明的，谁都不能取。”",
        "type": "ending_template",
        "rule": "deai_ending_template",
        "severity": 2,
        "source": "rule"
      },
      {
        "sid": "S141",
        "pid": "P82",
        "start": 2644,
        "end": 2717,
        "text": "壶底这圈绿锈，是三年内在潮湿铜器上生的；壶口有磕痕，磕在左唇第二道；壶里残着一层没洗掉的药渣，是铜锈清洗剂混樟脑与艾草——这是修表巷后院的味道。”",
        "type": "ending_template",
        "rule": "deai_ending_template",
        "severity": 2,
        "source": "rule"
      },
      {
        "sid": "S144",
        "pid": "P84",
        "start": 2745,
        "end": 2803,
        "text": "白寄南说，“换的时候你用两只新壳套了旧爵，想让我认错，再把我支到旧库去——旧库一封，我人在那边，这壶就过了你的手。”",
        "type": "ending_template",
        "rule": "deai_ending_template",
        "severity": 2,
        "source": "rule"
      },
      {
        "sid": "S148",
        "pid": "P86",
        "start": 2845,
        "end": 2872,
        "text": "而且它烫得比刚才更厉害——因为它离自己主人不到一尺。”",
        "type": "ending_template",
        "rule": "deai_ending_template",
        "severity": 2,
        "source": "rule"
      },
      {
        "sid": "S173",
        "pid": "P101",
        "start": 3320,
        "end": 3338,
        "text": "当众启封、当众验——白师傅，劳驾。”",
        "type": "ending_template",
        "rule": "deai_ending_template",
        "severity": 2,
        "source": "rule"
      },
      {
        "sid": "S124",
        "pid": "P73",
        "start": 2310,
        "end": 2323,
        "text": "崔三爷脸色一变：“那是……",
        "type": "expression_cliche",
        "rule": "expression_template",
